WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:14.920
Hi, my name is Yu Li, and I am the owner of
Tang Hot Pot in Chinatown.

00:00:15.440 --> 00:00:18.840
Hot Pot is one of the most popular cuisines
in Chinese culture.

00:00:18.840 --> 00:00:23.800
You put a simmering soup in the middle of
the table, and then you can choose different

00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:24.960
flavors of broth.

00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:29.520
The one we serve at Tang Hot Pot is the spicy
beef tallow broth.

00:00:29.520 --> 00:00:35.640
You cook it with beef fat and a lot of Chinese
ingredients and spices, like chili peppercorn,

00:00:35.640 --> 00:00:42.500
star anise, dry chili, and goji, so it really
has that complex flavor that is unique in

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:43.680
Sichuan hot pot.

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:49.019
This is actually our signature Tang Pot.

00:00:49.019 --> 00:00:54.550
Inside is the pork bone broth cooked with
chicken, and outside is the spicy beef tallow.

00:00:54.550 --> 00:00:57.269
The first thing you would do in hot pot is
pick a dipping sauce.

00:00:57.269 --> 00:01:02.420
The traditional dipping sauce that is matched
with the spicy broth is sesame oil.

00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:04.559
Here you see our Sichuan Adventurer Platter.

00:01:04.559 --> 00:01:09.070
We have swamp eel and pork blood, which people
might have never heard of in a restaurant

00:01:09.070 --> 00:01:09.960
before.

00:01:10.070 --> 00:01:14.500
But if you want to taste authentic Sichuan
cuisine and see what they really eat there,

00:01:14.500 --> 00:01:15.979
this would be the platter you order.

00:01:15.979 --> 00:01:20.390
I always recommend that people put in the
vegetables first, because it takes the longest

00:01:20.390 --> 00:01:25.659
time to cook, and so the vegetables won't
absorb the flavor of other ingredients.

00:01:25.659 --> 00:01:30.240
After I put in the vegetables, the next thing
I recommend is putting in the meat and the

00:01:30.240 --> 00:01:31.240
organs.

00:01:31.240 --> 00:01:33.780
I just put in the beef tongue.

00:01:33.780 --> 00:01:38.460
Dip it nine or 10 times until you don't see
any red on the meat.

00:01:38.460 --> 00:01:39.340
It might be a little spicy.

00:01:41.320 --> 00:01:44.950
The next thing I would put in is the beef
tripe, which is also called beef stomach.

00:01:44.950 --> 00:01:48.710
It's one of the signature dishes in Sichuan
cuisine.

00:01:48.710 --> 00:01:50.759
Eight seconds and then this is good to eat.

00:01:50.759 --> 00:01:54.920
The meat I'm putting in now is prime ribeye.

00:01:54.920 --> 00:01:59.560
Since the meat is so fresh and premium you
only need to put it in for eight or 10 seconds,

00:01:59.560 --> 00:02:00.990
and then you can eat it.

00:02:00.990 --> 00:02:05.500
I like to eat my meat in the clear broth,
so I can get the most taste out of the meat.

00:02:05.500 --> 00:02:13.520
At last, I recommend putting in the pork blood,
the swamp eel, and the chicken gizzard.

00:02:13.520 --> 00:02:18.790
It's better to eat them after you boil them
for two or three minutes, so they can absorb

00:02:18.790 --> 00:02:21.290
all the flavor that's already in the soup.

00:02:21.290 --> 00:02:27.380
I recommend people put the seafood in after
meat so the broth won't taste like seafood.

00:02:27.380 --> 00:02:31.130
Last, I would put in the starches, like the
vermicelli noodles.

00:02:31.130 --> 00:02:35.550
Any starch will absorb all the flavors and
thicken the soup.

00:02:35.550 --> 00:02:39.540
But everyone has their own way of cooking
hot pot.

00:02:42.800 --> 00:02:47.860
I've been going to Chengdu and trying hot
pot since I was little, so I had the flavor

00:02:47.940 --> 00:02:49.660
in my palate.

00:02:49.660 --> 00:02:53.530
When I moved to New York, I felt like this
was something that could open the whole hot

00:02:53.530 --> 00:02:56.780
pot experience to people who had never had
hot pot before.

00:02:56.780 --> 00:02:59.910
It's good for going out with friends and family.

00:02:59.910 --> 00:03:03.660
You guys are all cooking together, and there's
a lot of teaching.

00:03:03.660 --> 00:03:06.560
That's what I try to bring to New York from
Chengdu.

